    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>My Suika: Kyo's Fruit Merge </strong>\ud83c\udf49</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the world of <strong>My Suika</strong>, a charming and fun fruit merge puzzle game that\u2019s as kawaii as it is addictive! \ud83c\udf4e\ud83c\udf47\ud83c\udf4c</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drop &amp; Merge Gameplay</strong>: Strategically combine fruits to create bigger ones and maximize your score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable Rewards</strong>: Earn watermelon seeds to unlock unique fruit skins, vibrant backgrounds, and exciting game modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power-Up Frenzy</strong>: Shake up the game with power-ups like Shake, Surge, and Smash to clear the board and boost your combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adorable Visuals</strong>: Enjoy colorful, hand-crafted artwork with a touch of kawaii charm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competitive Leaderboards</strong>: Compete with friends and players worldwide to claim the top spot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relax or Challenge Yourself</strong>: Choose between casual play or intense score-chasing action.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're unwinding after a long day or aiming to crush the global leaderboard, <strong>My Suika</strong> is the perfect mix of relaxation and excitement. \ud83c\udf1f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the fruity frenzy today!</strong> \ud83c\udf4d\u2728<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671970/extras/4a09b2a79b4d83d86d495e7543610a21.avif?t=1733375343\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span> </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>My Suika: Kyo's Fruit Merge </strong>\ud83c\udf49</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the world of <strong>My Suika</strong>, a charming and fun fruit merge puzzle game that\u2019s as kawaii as it is addictive! \ud83c\udf4e\ud83c\udf47\ud83c\udf4c</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drop &amp; Merge Gameplay</strong>: Strategically combine fruits to create bigger ones and maximize your score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable Rewards</strong>: Earn watermelon seeds to unlock unique fruit skins, vibrant backgrounds, and exciting game modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power-Up Frenzy</strong>: Shake up the game with power-ups like Shake, Surge, and Smash to clear the board and boost your combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adorable Visuals</strong>: Enjoy colorful, hand-crafted artwork with a touch of kawaii charm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competitive Leaderboards</strong>: Compete with friends and players worldwide to claim the top spot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relax or Challenge Yourself</strong>: Choose between casual play or intense score-chasing action.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're unwinding after a long day or aiming to crush the global leaderboard, <strong>My Suika</strong> is the perfect mix of relaxation and excitement. \ud83c\udf1f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the fruity frenzy today!</strong> \ud83c\udf4d\u2728<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671970/extras/4a09b2a79b4d83d86d495e7543610a21.avif?t=1733375343\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span> </p>",
